: # Bitter — Social Media Web App Frontend repo for Bitter, a full-stack social media web application. ## Architecture Backend infrastructure was provisioned and managed directly via AWS Console/CLI as part of a production deployment: - **Compute:** EC2 running Node.js (managed with PM2) - **Load Balancing:** Application Load Balancer (ALB) with Auto Scaling - **Database:** Amazon RDS - **Networking:** Custom VPC with public/private subnets - **CDN:** CloudFront This repo contains the frontend code. Backend services were configured directly in AWS (not committed as infrastructure-as-code) as part of hands-on cloud deployment work. ## My Role Designed and deployed the AWS architecture end-to-end — EC2 setup, ALB/Auto Scaling configuration, VPC networking, and RDS integration — while building and maintaining the frontend.
